  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 604.01 Enforcement Provisions",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-02-27",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 604.01 Enforcement Provisions.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 21-P:19, any peace officer of the state of New Hampshire shall have the authority to enforce these rules.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 266:72-a, V(b), each person subject to these rules shall submit accounts, books, records, memoranda, correspondence, and other documents for inspection, upon demand of any peace officer, during regular business hours.\n\n(c) Each motor carrier who transports hazardous materials and is required to return notices, reports, and other information on a periodic or incident basis pursuant to the federal regulations shall likewise notify the department in the same manner as is required for federal agencies. A photocopy of written reports furnished to the appropriate federal agency shall be accepted.\n\n(d) Any notification pursuant to (c) above shall be submitted by telephone, as applicable, to (603) 223-3888, or in writing to:\n\nThe Assistant Commissioner of Safety\n\nJames H. Hayes Building\n\n33 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, N.H. 03305\n\nSource. #1461 eff. 10-16-79; ss by #2249, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2945, eff 1-3-85, EXPIRED: 1-3-91\n\nNew. #5219, eff 9-4-91; ss by #6562, Interim, eff 9-4-97, EXPIRES: 1-2-98; ss by #6615, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED:10-25-05\n\nNew. #8507, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRED: 6-5-06\n\nNew. #8721-B, eff 9-8-06, EXPIRED: 9-8-14\n\nNew. #12373, INTERIM, eff 8-31-17, EXPIRED: 2-27-18\n\nNew. #12516, eff 4-23-18",
